 to the consumer  specifically and when the consumers  overwhelm with so many choices and so  many websites and so many apps so many  places to do the purchasing to be able  to really create something specific to  him or her is really differentiating  I'll just add one area that we've  struggled with and I'll kind of share  with you what our data driven solution  has been so that's fit and fit is  incredibly important to rent the runway  again people are renting for the most  special events in their lives they  wanted to fit and work out we have like  one chance to make that happen because  the dress gets there the day before  sometimes the day of their event so it's  this important high stakes thing for us  and we actually found that there wasn't  really great big data out there that was  helping with fit or that was at least  letting women feel comfortable and  confident about fit we talked to  thousands of women tens of thousands of  women were like why is this and the  answer we kind of found and we believe  as women ourselves is that it's not just  will this dress fit its will this dress  look good on me so I think there's that  element combined with that but like  every single woman think she has a  unique body type like and she does do  some extent but like she's convinced  that like the typical rules of data  cannot be applied and she actually needs  to see it on herself so what we decided  was the closest thing we could do to get  to that was to create a shopping engine  that was actually driven by photos of  real women so we had women on rent the  runway who are naturally sending in  reviews of the dresses they had worn and  they wanted to share with the community  how great they they felt and they loved  we started asking them all what's your  height your weight your bust size and  women were like fine and great to share  this with that so they started doing  that and then we now enable women  through a concept called our runway to  shop via those photos 